    {
      "source": "Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal stick.",
      "translation": "著名遗言：让我们用金属棍子戳一戳这个放电丧尸。"
    },
    {
      "source": "That's exactly what we need: more dead bodies.",
      "translation": "这正是我们需要的：更多的尸体。"
    },
    {
      "source": "It needs a coffin, not a knife.",
      "translation": "它需要的是一副棺材，而不是一把刀。"
    }
  ],
  "entries": [
    {
      "context": null,
      "developer_comments": "~ NPC dialogue line\n~ Well, I think it's obvious that someone people might be intimidated by\nour cybernetic enhancements. Rightfully so.  Might even think we're part of\nthe Enemy.  You, though?  Normal, by their standards.  I think we stand a\nbetter chance.",
      "flags": [],
      "id": "d5a0f23f9c9d20421e94aedaaab832993a7cdf8b91399e8366778576d17bbd4e",
      "identity": [
        null,
        "Well an' surely, some folk'll take a mightly long squint at the bright'n'steelies on me an' feel a MITE uneasy, aye?  And rightly so, an I'm ken.  Might even reckon us kin'o'the Enemy.  But you?  By their reckonin', yer ordinary.  Normal.  Regular clap.  Gives us a finer chance, I'd razz.",
        null
      ],
      "occurrences": [
        [
          "data/json/npcs/exodii/exodii_merchant_missions.json",
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "plural": null,
      "singular": "Well an' surely, some folk'll take a mightly long squint at the bright'n'steelies on me an' feel a MITE uneasy, aye?  And rightly so, an I'm ken.  Might even reckon us kin'o'the Enemy.  But you?  By their reckonin', yer ordinary.  Normal.  Regular clap.  Gives us a finer chance, I'd razz.",
      "translator_comments": ""
    },
